{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55640","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十八 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松阴疎冷罩寒门，静见吾宗已绝伦。\n驱得万途归理窟，更无一事出心源。\n烟云忽闭岩前洞，鷄犬时闻林下村。\n放旷本来无别意，免教停海起波痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}